   "id": "P016",
   "texts": [
    "Auto-assign public IP subnet feature",
    "Auto-assign public IP subnet feature:",
    "• Only instances launched in a default Amazon VPC receive a public IP",
    "address during creation.",
    "• Instances created in custom VPCs require overriding the default",
    "setting to receive public IP addresses.",
    "• Alternatively, configure the Modify auto-assign IP settings on",
    "subnets to automatically assign public IP addresses to instances.",
    "• Unlike Elastic IP addresses, public IP addresses are not static."
   ],
