   "id": "P021",
   "texts": [
    "Key Takeaways",
    "• Amazon VPC helps provision logically isolated",
    "networks on AWS.",
    "• Subnets are classified as public or private based",
    "on their associated route tables.",
    "• Security groups are stateful and NACLs are",
    "stateless firewalls. They are applied at elastic",
    "network interface and subnet levels",
    "respectively."
   ],
   "notes": [],
   "hidden": false,
