    "VPC peering limitations",
    "The VPC peering limitations include:",
    "• No overlapping IP address ranges.",
    "• No transitive peering, edge routing, or internet",
    "gateway access.",
    "• No NAT routing between VPCs.",
    "• No DNS lookup resolution of private IP",
    "addresses.",
    "• Supports cross-referencing security groups",
    "across Regions.",
