   "texts": [
    "Module 7: Networking",
    "Troubleshooting networks on AWS"
   ],
   "notes": [],
   "hidden": false,
   "rendered": [],
   "img": "img/p-48.jpg"
  },
  {
   "id": "P049",
   "texts": [
    "Common troubleshooting tasks",
    "1. Verify that the instance is up and running.",
    "• Check that it has passed both the System Status and Instance",
    "Status checks.",
    "2. Verify that the security groups associated with the",
    "instance allow connections for the required protocols",
    "and ports.",
    "3. Verify that the network ACLs associated with the subnet",
    "allow traffic from the necessary ports and protocols.",
    "4. Verify that the route table associated with the subnet",
    "has destination rules that point to the appropriate",
    "targets."
   ],
   "notes": [],
   "hidden": false,
   "rendered": [],
   "img": "img/p-49.jpg"
  },
  {
   "id": "P050",
   "texts": [
    "Troubleshooting instance connections",
    "Common troubleshooting tasks",
    "• Verify that the instance is",
    "running.",
    "• Verify security groups rules.",
    "• Verify network ACL rules.",
    "• Verify route table rules.",
    "If you cannot connect to the instance via the internet:",
    "• Verify the public IP address or DNS name you are using is",
    "correct.",
    "• Verify the instance has a public IP address or Elastic IP",
    "address.",
    "• Verify that an internet gateway is attached to the",
    "instance’s VPC.",
    "• Verify that the route table of the instance’s subnet has a",
    "route rule for the destination 0.0.0.0/0 via the internet",
    "gateway."
   ],
   "notes": [],
   "hidden": false,
   "rendered": [],
   "img": "img/p-50.jpg"
  },
  {
   "id": "P051",
   "texts": [
    "Troubleshooting SSH connections",
    "Common troubleshooting tasks",
    "• Verify that the instance is",
    "running.",
    "• Verify port 22 is open in the",
    "security group.",
    "• Verify network ACL rules.",
    "• Verify route table rules.",
    "If you cannot connect to an instance using SSH:",
    "• Verify the instance connection credentials:",
    "• User name",
    "• Instance private key"
   ],
   "notes": [],
   "hidden": false,
   "rendered": [],
   "img": "img/p-51.jpg"
  },
  {
   "id": "P052",
   "texts": [
    "Troubleshooting NAT",
    "Common troubleshooting tasks",
    "• Verify that the instance is",
    "running.",
    "• Verify security groups rules.",
    "• Verify network ACL rules.",
    "• Verify route table rules.",
    "If the NAT configuration does not work:",
    "• NAT instance or NAT gateway:",
    "• Verify that the route table has a route to the NAT instance",
    "or NAT gateway",
    "• NAT instance:",
    "• Check to see if the Source/Dest Check is disabled.",
    "• Restart the NAT instance.",
    "• Check the inbound security group rules."
   ],
   "notes": [],
   "hidden": false,
   "rendered": [],
   "img": "img/p-52.jpg"
  },
  {
   "id": "P053",
   "texts": [
    "Troubleshooting VPC peering",
    "Common troubleshooting tasks",
    "• Verify that the instance is",
    "running.",
    "• Verify security groups rules.",
    "• Verify network ACL rules.",
    "• Verify route table rules.",
    "If you cannot reach resources in a peered network:",
    "• Make sure the peering request was approved.",
    "• Check the security group rules: Make sure to use the",
    "CIDR block range in VPC A to allow access from VPC B or",
    "use VPC A’s security group ID.",
    "• Check the network ACLs: Are you forbidding all external",
    "traffic?"
   ],
   "notes": [],
   "hidden": false,
   "rendered": [],
   "img": "img/p-53.jpg"
  },
