    "discussed today?",
    "Answer, but not limited to:",
    "1. Verify that the instance is up and running and check that it has passed both the",
    "System Status and Instance Status checks.",
    "2. Verify that the security groups associated with the instance allow connections for",
    "the required protocols and ports.",
    "3. Verify that the network ACLs associated with the subnet allow traffic from the",
    "necessary ports and protocols.",
    "4. Verify that the route table associated with the subnet has destination rules that",
    "point to the appropriate targets."
